{% extends 'help/partials/base.html.twig' %}

{% set id = 'Problemset' %}

{% block header %}
    Problem statements
{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
    <p>
        You will find the problem statements on the Problemset page:
    </p>
    <img src="{{ asset('images/help/problemset.png') }}" alt="Problem statements" class="mb-3 rounded-3 img-fluid help-img">
    <p>
        Click the "text" button to open the PDF statement of a problem.
        Download "samples" to get sample inputs you can try your solution on.
        They are not the complete set your program has to pass, though: some tests are hidden.
    </p>
    <p>
        Below that you will also find code templates for each language. They contain the basic structure of the program
        and import all the libraries the solution will need (but feel free to add more).
    </p>
{% endblock %}
